{"height": 19, "weight": 950, "base_experience": 270, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "attack", "value": 3}], "genus": "Mach Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 40, "growth_rate": "slow", "egg_groups": ["monster", "dragon"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ガブリアス"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Gaburias"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "한카리아스"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "烈咬陸鯊"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Carchacrok"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Knakrack"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Garchomp"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Garchomp"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ガブリアス"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "烈咬陆鲨"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Garchomp"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["diamond", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed."}, {"versions": ["pearl", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "It flies at speeds equal to a jet fighter plane. It never allows its prey to escape."}, {"versions": ["platinum", "black", "white", "black-2", "white-2"], "text": "It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees."}, {"versions": ["heartgold", "soulsilver"], "text": "Its body is covered in fine scales that reduce drag, enabling it to fly at high speeds."}, {"versions": ["sun"], "text": "It can fly at speeds rivaling jet planes. It dives into flocks of bird Pokémon and gulps the entire flock down whole."}, {"versions": ["moon"], "text": "The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "It flies at the speed of sound while searching for prey, and it has midair battles with Salamence as the two compete for food."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "Its fine scales don’t just reduce wind resistance—their sharp edges also cause injury to any opponent who attacks it."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": 